OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court issues injunction to
OL,4,Astop Orange Order Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast High Court has issued a
OL,7,Ftemporary injunction stopping Sunday's
OL,8,FDrumcree parade.
OL,10,FOn Friday the Parades Commission
OL,11,Fannounced that the Orange Order parade
OL,12,Fcould proceed for the first time in
OL,13,Falmost 30 years with restrictions in
OL,14,Fplace.
OL,16,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition
OL,17,Fhad mounted a legal challenge and also
OL,18,Fapplied to the commission to stage a
OL,19,Fprotest with 5,000 participants if the
OL,20,Fparade went ahead.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
