OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court issues injunction to
OL,4,Astop Orange Order Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe injunction came after Portadown
OL,7,FDistrict Orange Lodge declined a
OL,8,Frequest from Judge Patricia Smyth to
OL,9,Fpostpone the parade along the mainly
OL,10,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road.
